*args* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''args()''

Returns the command line arguments passed to the program as a list of strings.

The script name is not included. ''args()[1]'' is the first argument after the script, not the script path itself.
An empty list is returned when no arguments are passed.

*Returns:*
- List of strings containing command line arguments
- ''err'' on failure
